WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.700
Open Gallery from the sidebar. Photos and albums live here.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.000
Open a photo to see its details.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.900
Click Edit to open it in the layer editor.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.100
Add a non-destructive adjustment layer, here Hue / Saturation.

5
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:22.000
Drag the sliders and watch the image change live.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.900
Click Apply. The adjustment lives on its own layer, so the original stays untouched.
